          "faIcon": "",
          "faIconColors": {
            "bg": "",
            "fill": ""
          },
          "locales": {
            "en": {
              "text": "<p>I'm a {{MERN Stack Developer}} with [[3+ years]] of experience building scalable, production-grade web applications and RESTful APIs. With a BSCS in Computer Science, I work across JavaScript, React.js, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and MySQL to deliver software that performs under real-world demand.</p><p>My focus is simple: turn complex requirements into clean architecture, reliable backends, and interfaces people enjoy using. From database design and API integration to responsive frontends, I build end-to-end solutions with maintainability in mind.</p><p>At Code Enterprise, I've contributed to live products — including HR platforms and internal tools — collaborating with designers, QA, and engineering teams in Agile environments to ship on time without compromising quality.</p><p>I care about performance, clarity, and long-term code health. Whether optimizing queries, refining UX flows, or structuring services for scale, I approach every problem with precision and intent.</p><p>[[Available for freelance and full-time opportunities.]] I'd love to hear about what you're building.</p>"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
